---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: products-nonslip.html
title: 논슬립
description: 계단과 경사로의 안전한 보행을 위한 하이탑 논슬립 제품군입니다.
bodyClass: bg-surface text-ink
---

<section class="relative mt-20 h-[36vh] min-h-[280px] max-h-[380px] overflow-hidden bg-night">
  <img src="{{ '/images/products/nonslip/install/hero.jpg' | url }}" alt="계단에 시공된 하이탑 논슬립 제품"
       class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-[center_55%]" width="842" height="530" fetchpriority="high">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-night/50"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-44 bg-gradient-to-t from-night/70 to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="container-hi relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col justify-end pb-9 text-white sm:pb-11">
    <nav aria-label="브레드크럼" class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-white/60">
      <a href="{{ '/' | url }}" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">홈</a>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">chevron_right</span>
      <span aria-current="page" class="text-white/90">논슬립</span>
    </nav>
    <span class="eyebrow-line !text-white/60">Non-Slip</span>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white [text-shadow:0_2px_18px_rgba(11,14,19,0.45)] sm:text-4xl">논슬립</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="product-index" class="scroll-mt-20 border-b border-line bg-surface py-14 lg:py-20">
  <div class="container-hi">
    <div class="grid items-end gap-7 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <span class="eyebrow-line">Product Portfolio</span>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-4xl">
          보행 환경에 맞춘 {{ products.nonslip.groups | length }}개 제품군
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="border-t border-ink/15 pt-5 leading-relaxed text-secondary lg:col-span-5">
        계단·교량 보도·경사로 등 적용 장소와 하중 조건을 고려해 소재와 구성을 선택할 수 있습니다.
        조달청 나라장터에 등록된 제품은 조달식별번호로 바로 조회하실 수 있습니다.
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3" aria-label="제품군 바로가기">
      {% for g in products.nonslip.groups %}
        <a href="#{{ g.id }}" class="filter-pill">{{ g.nameKo }}</a>
      {% endfor %}
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>

{% for g in products.nonslip.groups %}
  <section id="{{ g.id }}" class="scroll-mt-20 border-b border-line py-14 lg:py-20 {% if loop.index is even %}bg-section{% else %}bg-white{% endif %}">
    <div class="container-hi">

      <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center lg:gap-14">
        <div class="lg:col-span-6">
          <span class="font-display text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">{{ g.num }}</span>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-4xl">{{ g.nameKo }}</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 font-display text-[0.7rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-secondary/70">{{ g.nameEn }}</p>
          <p class="mt-5 text-pretty leading-relaxed text-secondary">{{ g.desc }}</p>
          {% if g.notes | length %}
            <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 border-t border-ink/12 pt-5">
              {% for n in g.notes %}
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-secondary">
                  <span class="text-accent" aria-hidden="true">*</span><span>{{ n }}</span>
                </li>
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-6">
          <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl ring-1 ring-line shadow-sm">
            <img src="{{ g.install | url }}" alt="{{ g.installAlt }}"
                 class="aspect-[16/10] w-full object-cover" loading="lazy">
          </figure>
          <figcaption class="mt-2.5 text-xs text-secondary/80">시공 사진</figcaption>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {% for m in g.models %}
          <article class="flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-white ring-1 ring-line transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:ring-primary/20 hover:shadow-[0_18px_45px_rgba(25,28,29,0.10)]">
            <div class="flex aspect-[4/3] items-center justify-center bg-white p-5">
              <img src="{{ m.img | url }}" alt="{{ m.name }} 논슬립 제품 사진"
                   class="h-full w-full object-contain" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-2 border-t border-line p-5">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink">{{ m.name }}</h3>
              {% if m.regName %}
                <p class="text-xs text-secondary/80">조달 등록명 {{ m.regName }}</p>
              {% endif %}
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-secondary">{{ m.spec }}</p>
              {% if m.codes | length %}
                <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-3">
                  {% for c in m.codes %}
                    <span class="rounded-full border border-primary/15 bg-primary/[0.05] px-3 py-1.5 font-display text-xs font-bold text-primary">
                      {% if c.label %}{{ c.label }} · {% endif %}조달 {{ c.no }}
                    </span>
                  {% endfor %}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
{% endfor %}

<section class="border-b border-line bg-white py-14 lg:py-18">
  <div class="container-hi">
    <div class="grid gap-7 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center lg:gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <span class="eyebrow-line">Procurement Information</span>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-3xl">상세 규격과 색상 안내</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-ink/15 pt-5 lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-secondary">
          제품별 색상과 상세 사양서는 제품 문의를 통해 안내해 드립니다.
          설치 장소와 사용 환경을 알려주시면 현장 조건에 맞는 제품을 검토할 수 있습니다.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set ctaTitle = "적합한 논슬립 제품을 찾고 계신가요?" %}
{% set ctaDesc = "현장 환경과 조건을 알려주시면 적용 가능한 제품과 규격을 안내해 드립니다." %}
{% set ctaSecondary = { label: "교량이음장치 보기", url: "/products-bridge.html" } %}
{% include "partials/cta-band.njk" %}
